          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تراث — turāth — \"heritage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تحافظ القرية على تراثها القديم. tuḥāfiẓu al-qarya ʿalā turāthihā al-qadīm. The village takes care of its old heritage."
