          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تراث (turāth) is built on the native Arabic root w-r-th (Lane), \"to inherit\". Lane explains turāth as wurāth with t in place of the w: what a people inherits."
            }
          ]
        },
